@startuml 01-单据主线-货怎么走
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,Arial"
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
  BorderColor #A5D6A7
  ArrowColor #607D8B
  FontSize 13
}

left to right direction

title 仓储单据主线：一张单据让货从哪到哪

state "供应商" as SUP
state "仓库 A" as WA
state "仓库 B" as WB
state "门店" as ST

SUP --> WA : 1 采购单（入仓）
WA --> ST : 2 配货单（出库）\n司机送货
ST --> WA : 4 退货单（退仓）\n司机取货
WA --> SUP : 8 退供单
WA --> WB : 6 仓间调拨单
WA -[dashed]-> WA : 5 库位转移单\n7 库存调整单
ST -[dashed]-> ST : 3 门店库存调整单

legend right
  实线：货真的在走
  虚线：货不进出仓库，只挪库位或调账
endlegend
@enduml
